              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Yethilo, mũthembi wa Mitiani, mũthoni wa Mose, eew’a onthe ala Yeova wekĩte ũndũ wa Mose, na ũndũ wa Isilaeli andũ make, ũndũ Yeova waumĩtye Isilaeli Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
